---
import DefaultBody from '../layouts/DefaultBody.astro';
import Hero   from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import BackToTop from '../components/BackToTop.astro';
---

<DefaultBody title="Department of Beta Testing - ATPLLC" description="AT Products LLC's DoBT beta tests versions during development before shipping!" keywords="AT Products, Ethical Hacking Society, The Script Community, AT Products LLC, ATproducts" author="Alex Toucan" 
  bulletin={[
    { bulletinImage: "DoBT@v2.7-081226-1.webp" },
    { bulletinImage: "DoBT@v2.7-081226-2.webp" },
    { bulletinImage: "DoBT@v2.7-081226-3.webp" },
  ]} 
>
  <div id="page">
    <Navbar />
    <div id="main-content">
      <Hero
        id="codinghome"
        title="AT Products LLC"
        titleClasses="main-title"
        secondaryTitle="Department of Beta Testing"
        secondaryTitleClasses="secondary-title"
        description="Welcome to AT Products's Department of Beta Testing's website portal!"
        buttons={[
          { href: "https://beta.atproducts.xyz/", text: "Beta Website", type: "primary" },
          { href: "https://atproducts.xyz/", text: "Main Website", type: "secondary" }
        ]}
        icons={[
          { icon: "github", desc: "GitHub", href: "https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/tree/beta-testing" },
          { icon: "twitter-x", desc: "Twitter / X", href: "https://twitter.com/ATProductsLLC" },
          { icon: "youtube", desc: "YouTube", href: "https://youtube.com/c/AlexToucanAT" },
          { icon: "envelope-fill", desc: "Contact Form / Email", href: "https://atproducts.xyz/contact/" },
          { icon: "cloud-sun-fill", desc: "Weather", href: "https://twitter.com/ATPWeather" },
        ]}
      />
      <div id="carousel-A" class="carousel carousel-main carousel-fade container mt-6" data-bs-autoplay="true">
        <div class="carousel-inner rounded-5">
          <div class="carousel-item active" data-bs-interval="6000">
            <img src="/media/slideshow/DoBT@v2.7-081226-1.webp" class="d-block w-100" alt="DoBT v2.7 Release Slide 1">
          </div>
          <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="6000">
            <img src="/media/slideshow/DoBT@v2.7-081226-2.webp" class="d-block w-100" alt="DoBT v2.7 Release Slide 2">
          </div>
          <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="6000">
            <img src="/media/slideshow/DoBT@v2.7-081226-3.webp" class="d-block w-100" alt="DoBT v2.7 Release Slide 3">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
          <div class="carousel-indicators">
            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-A" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-A" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-A" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex gap-1">
            <button class="btn-icon btn-sm carousel-control-play-pause" type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-A" aria-label="Pause" data-bs-pause-label="Pause" data-bs-play-label="Play">
              <span class="carousel-icon-pause" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="carousel-icon-play" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <a href="/media/pdf/DoBT@v2.7 Patch Notes.pdf" class="btn-icon btn-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf-fill"></i>
              <span class="visually-hidden">PDF Download</span>
            </a>
            <button class="btn-icon btn-sm" type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-A" data-bs-slide="prev">
              <span class="carousel-icon-prev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
            </button>
            <button class="btn-icon btn-sm" type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-A" data-bs-slide="next">
              <span class="carousel-icon-next" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <main id="index" class="container">
        <hr class="hero-drappear">
        <div id="about-us">
          <h2>About Us</h2>
          <p>Welcome to the Department of Beta Testing (DoBT) at AT Products LLC (ATPLLC). Our abbreviations are recognized as ATPLLC-DoBT (full and regularly used), or ATPDoBT (shorter name used). We are dedicated to testing and improving the <a href="https://atproducts.xyz">main department's website</a> to enhance the user experience for our current and future customers.</p>
          <p>Join us in shaping the future of our platform! As a beta tester, your contributions are invaluable. Your feedback helps us identify and address issues, refine features, and ensure a seamless experience for all users.</p>
          <p>Why not <a href="/apply">apply today</a>? Your insights and suggestions can make a significant difference. We greatly appreciate our beta testers' time and effort in helping us achieve excellence.</p>
          <p>Our goals include:</p>
          <ul>
              <li>Identifying and resolving bugs and glitches to enhance website functionality.</li>
              <li>Gathering user feedback to improve usability and user interface design.</li>
              <li>Testing new features and functionalities to meet user expectations and needs.</li>
              <li>Ensuring compatibility across various devices, browsers, and platforms.</li>
              <li>Providing timely updates and enhancements to keep the website dynamic and engaging.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Since March 18th, 2024, the Department of Beta Testing has been crucial in developing and refining AT Products LLC's online presence and has been improving our metrics.</p>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <div id="what-new">
          <h2> What's New? </h2>
          <p>
            <b>Released On:</b> August 12th, 2026.<br>
            <b>ATP Database:</b> DoBT v2.7
          </p>
          <b>Changed</b>
          <ul>
            <li>Updated Bootstrap from v5.3.8 to v6.0.0-dev, as part of migrating:
              <ul>
                <li>Import Bootstrap's new ESM script &amp; CSS. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/091016a">091016a</a>)</li>
                <li>Overhauled the navbar. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/849673a">849673a</a>)</li>
                <li>Overhauled the carousel. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/16d88a8">16d88a8</a> &amp; <a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/f897278">f897278</a>)</li>
                <li>Fixed pages to match the new classes. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/19126f1">19126f1</a> &amp; <a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/f93a24e">f93a24e</a>)</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Changed the default body font to Geist. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/0ed8ce4">0ed8ce4</a>)</li>
            <li>Changed the "AT Products LLC" title (index) font to Croogla 4F. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/317034e">317034e</a>)</li>
            <li>Changed the "Department of Beta Testing" secondary title (index) font to Cascadia Code. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/60f25e7">60f25e7</a>)</li>
            <li>Reformatted the hero internally. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/3d6ac6b">3d6ac6b</a>)</li>
            <li>Changed CSP to netlify.toml. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/1d55cfd">1d55cfd</a>)</li>
            <li>Updated React from v19.2.0 to v19.2.8. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/22cc62a">22cc62a</a>)</li>
            <li>Updated Astro from v6.1.7 to v7.2.0. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/ab94b83">ab94b83</a> &amp; <a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/639e832">639e832</a>)
              <ul>
                <li>Fixed certain pages for Astro@v7. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/ad13a1a">ad13a1a</a>)</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Updated @astrojs/react from v5.0.3 to v6.0.2. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/ab94b83">ab94b83</a>)</li>
            <li>Updated jQuery from v3.7.1 to v4.0.0. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/9142560">9142560</a>)</li>
            <li>Updated jQuery UI from v1.14.1 to v1.14.2. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/9142560">9142560</a>)</li>
            <li>Updated @types/jquery from v3.5.33 to v4.0.1. (<a href="https://github.com/Alex-Toucan/atproducts.xyz/commit/9142560">9142560</a>)</li>
          </ul>
          <p><b>Check 2.25, 2.25.1 &amp; 2.25.2 changelogs for any security vulnerablity patches.</b></p>
        </div>
      </main>
      <Footer />
    </div>
    <BackToTop />
  </div>
</DefaultBody>
